# Hand-curated indicators for this site. Rebuilt into master.dat by
# /usr/local/bin/zeek-intel-update.sh -- edit here, never edit master.dat.
#
# TAB-separated, four columns, no header:
#   indicator <TAB> indicator_type <TAB> meta.source <TAB> meta.desc
#
# indicator_type is one of:
#   Intel::ADDR  Intel::DOMAIN  Intel::URL  Intel::SUBNET
#   Intel::EMAIL Intel::FILE_HASH  Intel::CERT_HASH  Intel::SOFTWARE
#
# meta.source MUST be "local" for these -- Wazuh rule 100902 keys on it and
# alerts at level 14, above the public-feed rules.
#
# Example (commented):
#203.0.113.66	Intel::ADDR	local	Known-bad seen in prior incident
